me": "capture 1.png", "id": "783698660711990", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_783698664045323_5210865340295355557_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0T0FTWqK2CMQ7kNvwFx1l0b&_nc_oc=AdrLYf2J0aProtlvlNsAbXdZnlPJ2HKZ2BpO0Uqc5Jy9XvLoyGHzl5JCOO_R6mvu9GY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVtz-GlCpXECHsfUqKbM1zvOKD0Io8SWykEle_GIVnWrw&oe=6B103F73"}, {"file_name": "capture 5.png", "id": "4158663734376507", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819464_4158663737709840_5173086170138774773_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yog04XbGRGAQ7kNvwHt4ggH&_nc_oc=Adq9TdFTOq4sZQeVtXpbnkvA62WWxjgszhJW-AAIInzf_lYVeNMzsDSOOOSegkuN3FI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUzwjDAjPueOEenKuvqhSxkFvY7ITIVsxf74Cd0ChS91A&oe=6B103892"}, {"file_name": "capture combat_1.10.1.png", "id": "780930228047748", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827096_780930231381081_2881658998307427268_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p0k6z08kxYEQ7kNvwEkzMBO&_nc_oc=AdrRhUbau8Kqep7aTGF-0ySrRkPUnq5J1HMj-f-7oUTETperPjoMWWStiFCssMfrll8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVNA5fGfXnPAzYbyg6RnzHuagfvxdnxKvTWKoSS5Zgvig&oe=6B105B33"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CM StoRE - couverture paysage.png", "id": "810281675275931", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827038_810281678609264_4909290266648874459_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pm2G3RJhKk8Q7kNvwFZkUhK&_nc_oc=AdpUzz3BJchHmjsH54222t3bGTG4rHd24w_udAtWD8ZDJSo8qN_xhwM5ulVhGhs4msI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU8T0IlzP5UKd7QAG8-hnV1VatJSBagmfPEqt3Vkbx8Yg&oe=6B1057A5"}, "display_name": "Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha", "keywords": ["combat", "magic", "crepe", "spell", "action"], "long_description": "# Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha is a fun solo adventure in magical girl style! Become a Cr\u00eape Goddess and protect earth against an alien army!\n\n# Features: \n\n1. BONK WITH YOUR MAGICAL PAN: Mix heavy and light hits, aim for weak spots, and take back the stolen ingredients! \n{1331214528437222}\n\n2. CRAFT SPELLS WITH INGREDIENTS: To cast spells you have to craft them prior. Enter a Crepo-Trance, grab the right ingredients, and mix up cr\u00eapes at a lightning speed. Unleash them later in battle with a pose!\n{793123986817059}\n\n3. MAGICAL GIRL POSE: Pose like a true Magical Girl to summon your freshly cooked cr\u00eapes and cast powerful spells. Just move your arms and fire them off!\n{1132416108744724}\n\n# YOUR STORY: YOU ARE A CR\u00caPE GODDESS HANA\u2026.\n\nIn the far reaches of space, a tyrant has sworn to destroy the Cr\u00eape, the universal symbol of joy and community. \n\nOn Earth, an ordinary student finds a ruby-studded pan and, by cooking the best cr\u00eape in the universe, awakens the powers of the Cr\u00eape Goddess!\n\nShe then learns a shocking secret: our planet is actually a cr\u00eape\u2026 and therefore flat. If the Cr\u00eape is destroyed, the world will fall with it....\n\n-> If you like the concept and want to support development (or just share cr\u00eape memes), join our Discord community and give us your feedback! \nhttps://discord.gg/t4JbDdpGQU\n", "short_description": "Cr\u00eape Master! is a fast and crazy combat game where you fight like a magical girl. Become the Cr\u00eape Goddess, smash aliens with your magical pan and cast cr\u00eape-powered spells by striking real magical girl poses with your arms.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hallucinations-studio.com/cm_privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hallucinations Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hallucinations-